{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":6,"ref":"zechariah 1:6","book":"zechariah","lang":"id","chapter":1,"translation":"Tetapi firman-Ku dan ketetapan-Ku, yang kuiperintahkan ⟨את⟩ hamba-hamba-Ku, para nabi — bukankah itu telah menimpa bapa-bapa leluhurmu? Lalu mereka berbalik dan berkata: ‘Sesuai yang direncanakan Yahweh Tsevaot untuk melakukan kepada kami, sesuai dengan jalan-jalan kami dan sesuai dengan perbuatan-perbuatan kami, demikianlah ⟨Ia⟩ telah berbuat kepada kami.’","tokens":[{"surface":"אך","gloss":"Tetapi"},{"surface":"דברי","gloss":"firman-Ku"},{"surface":"וחקי","gloss":"dan ketetapan-Ku"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"yang"},{"surface":"צויתי","gloss":"kuiperintahkan"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"hamba-hamba-Ku"},{"surface":"עבדי","gloss":"hamba-hamba-Ku"},{"surface":"הנביאים","gloss":"para nabi"},{"surface":"הלוא","gloss":"bukankah"},{"surface":"השיגו","gloss":"telah menimpa"},{"surface":"אבתיכם","gloss":"bapa-bapa leluhurmu"},{"surface":"וישובו","gloss":"Lalu mereka berbalik"},{"surface":"ויאמרו","gloss":"dan berkata"},{"surface":"כאשר","gloss":"Sesuai yang"},{"surface":"זמם","gloss":"direncanakan"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahweh"},{"surface":"צבאות","gloss":"Tsevaot"},{"surface":"לעשות","gloss":"untuk melakukan"},{"surface":"לנו","gloss":"kepada kami"},{"surface":"כדרכינו","gloss":"sesuai dengan jalan-jalan kami"},{"surface":"וכמעללינו","gloss":"dan sesuai dengan perbuatan-perbuatan kami"},{"surface":"כן","gloss":"demikianlah"},{"surface":"עשה","gloss":"telah berbuat"},{"surface":"אתנו","gloss":"⟨את⟩ kepada kami"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-24T17:55:27.108189617Z","model":"glm-5.2"}